WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.760
The first picture of a black hole.

00:02.448 --> 00:09.608
Far beyond our galaxy, in the galaxy M87, is a black hole with the mass of six and a half billion Suns.

00:10.176 --> 00:15.260
In 2019 eight radio telescopes working together made the first picture of one.

00:15.728 --> 00:17.298
Here it is drawn as a model.

00:17.913 --> 00:20.796
Its dark shadow is bigger than our whole Solar System.
